      "content": "That makes sense. I get the pressure differential part now. One more thing though—I've noticed that when the turbo really kicks in, it makes this really high-pitched whistling or howling sound. Is that just a byproduct of the air being forced through so fast, or is there a specific mechanical reason for that specific sound?",
